WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Smooth is already part of the draft.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
I choose Stippling for the outer gum surface.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.500
One slider controls how deep the dimples are.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.500
I preview the texture before adopting it.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.750
Before includes my earlier smoothing.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.500
After adds only the proposed dimples.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Applying the finish creates a second edit record.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.500
I reopen Stippling and make the dimples shallower.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Updating replaces the finish in the same record.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
I withdraw just the Stippling adjustment.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The texture is gone. Smooth stays in the draft.
